DEFN="""UNEARNED needs a written statement, dated after the job's claim, by a verifier, judge, incident report or the owner, saying THIS job's claim did not hold: result missing or defective, false or stale claim, wrong artifact, or required step not done. The statement must name the job id or the job's specific artifact (video number, feature, report).
Counts: owner-stated defect or failed requirement; judge rejection of what the job claimed to have met.
Does NOT count: owner taste with no stated defect; honest negative results; parts the handoff itself disclosed as unfinished; later changes of plan; a later stage failing a gate the job never claimed; defects from a different job; a later fix job existing, by itself; anyone's reading of the artifact with no written statement. If unsure: UNKNOWN."""
